</td>
<td valign="bottom" width="124">
<p align="center"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><strong>R$ 778,46</strong></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td valign="top" width="270">
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><strong>de 51 a 150 unidades</strong></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="bottom" width="124">
<p align="center"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><strong>R$ 1.111,90</strong></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td valign="top" width="270">
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><strong>de 151 a 250 unidades</strong></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="bottom" width="124">
<p align="center"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><strong>R$ 1.900,39</strong></span></p>
